* ==============================================================================
* SMACD 2027 Open-Source Design Challenge
* Circuit: Top-Level 24-28 GHz 2-Stage SiGe-BiCMOS Low-Noise Amplifier
* Technology: IHP SG13G2 130nm SiGe BiCMOS (fT = 300 GHz)
* SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
* ==============================================================================

.subckt lna_top GND VCC VBIAS1 VBIAS2 RFIN RFOUT

* --- Active HBT Transistors ---
* Stage 1 Common-Emitter Q1 (Nx=2: parallel pair Q1A, Q1B):
Q1A CAS1_MID LB GND GND npn13G2 we=70n le=900n Nx=1
Q1B CAS1_MID LB GND GND npn13G2 we=70n le=900n Nx=1

* Stage 1 Cascode Common-Base Q3 (Nx=2: parallel pair Q3A, Q3B):
Q3A OUT1 VB_CAS1 CAS1_MID GND npn13G2 we=70n le=900n Nx=1
Q3B OUT1 VB_CAS1 CAS1_MID GND npn13G2 we=70n le=900n Nx=1

* Stage 2 Common-Emitter Q2 (Nx=1):
Q2 CAS2_MID B2 GND GND npn13G2 we=70n le=900n Nx=1

* Stage 2 Cascode Common-Base Q4 (Nx=1):
Q4 OUT2 VB_CAS2 CAS2_MID GND npn13G2 we=70n le=900n Nx=1

* --- Bias Resistors ---
R1 VBIAS1 LB GND rhigh w=0.5u l=0.96u
R2 VBIAS2 B2 GND rhigh w=0.5u l=0.96u
R3 VCC VB_CAS1 GND rhigh w=0.5u l=0.96u
R4 VCC VB_CAS2 GND rhigh w=0.5u l=0.96u

* --- MIM Capacitors ---
* Input DC Blocking:
C1 RFIN N_IN GND rfcmim w=7u l=7u wfeed=3u
* Input Shunt Matching (4 series caps to GND):
C_SH1 N_IN N_S1 GND rfcmim w=7u l=7u wfeed=3u
C_SH2 N_S1 N_S2 GND rfcmim w=7u l=7u wfeed=3u
C_SH3 N_S2 N_S3 GND rfcmim w=7u l=7u wfeed=3u
C_SH4 N_S3 GND GND rfcmim w=7u l=7u wfeed=3u
* Cascode Bypasses:
C2 VB_CAS1 GND GND rfcmim w=7u l=7u wfeed=3u
C3 VB_CAS2 GND GND rfcmim w=7u l=7u wfeed=3u
* Interstage Tuning & Blocking:
C4 OUT1 GND GND rfcmim w=7u l=7u wfeed=3u
C5 OUT1 B2 GND rfcmim w=7u l=7u wfeed=3u
* Output Tank Shunt (2 series caps):
C6 OUT2 N_CP GND rfcmim w=7u l=7u wfeed=3u
C7 N_CP GND GND rfcmim w=7u l=7u wfeed=3u
* Output DC Blocking (3 series caps):
C8 OUT2 N_CO1 GND rfcmim w=7u l=7u wfeed=3u
C9 N_CO1 N_CO2 GND rfcmim w=7u l=7u wfeed=3u
C10 N_CO2 RFOUT GND rfcmim w=7u l=7u wfeed=3u

* --- Spiral Inductors (inductor3 w=2u s=2.1u d=25.85u nr_r=2) ---
* Input matching chain:
L1 N_IN LC1_0 N_L1 GND inductor3 w=2u s=2.1u d=25.85u nr_r=2
L2 N_L1 LC1_1 N_L2 GND inductor3 w=2u s=2.1u d=25.85u nr_r=2
L3 N_L2 LC1_2 N_L3 GND inductor3 w=2u s=2.1u d=25.85u nr_r=2
L4 N_L4 LC1_3 N_L3 GND inductor3 w=2u s=2.1u d=25.85u nr_r=2
L5 N_L5 LC1_4 N_L4 GND inductor3 w=2u s=2.1u d=25.85u nr_r=2
L6 LB LC1_5 N_L5 GND inductor3 w=2u s=2.1u d=25.85u nr_r=2

* Interstage load:
L7 OUT1 LC2A N_INT GND inductor3 w=2u s=2.1u d=25.85u nr_r=2
L8 N_INT LC2B VCC GND inductor3 w=2u s=2.1u d=25.85u nr_r=2

* Output load:
L9 OUT2 LC3A N_OUT GND inductor3 w=2u s=2.1u d=25.85u nr_r=2
L10 N_OUT LC3B VCC GND inductor3 w=2u s=2.1u d=25.85u nr_r=2

.ends lna_top
